 "name": "ST44MILITARY.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "The war between",
  "the AEUG and the Titans",
  "was fought not only",
  "in the Gryps sector,",
  "but everywhere.",
  "Spurred by the 30 Bunch Incident,",
  "the AEUG had turned to armed",
  "struggle, and rose up again and",
  "again all over the Earth Sphere.",
  "Some were nothing more",
  "than riots,",
  "but revolts using mobile suits",
  "and space warships",
  "broke out one after another.",
  "The Titans made the most of this",
  "as propaganda,",
  "trumpeting that the AEUG",
  "was a front for Zeon remnants",
  "as they kept up the crackdown,",
  "but that only invited",
  "further counterattacks",
  "from the AEUG.",
  "Colony Politics",
  "Mobile Suit Development",
  "Space colonies, several dozen",
  "to a unit called a Side,",
  "float at the",
  "Lagrange points.",
  "Colony management was handled",
  "by a semi-public body called",
  "the Colony Corporation, which",
  "held a monopoly on the know-how;",
  "but since their own",
  "political interests",
  "were already firmly secured,",
  "they showed no inclination",
  "toward political ambition.",
  "Not every colony",
  "was wiped out at the start",
  "of the One Year War.",
  "Pro-Zeon colonies,",
  "or any colony that had declared",
  "neutrality, lay low",
  "during the war",
  "and survived the fighting.",
  "Even in Side 1 and Side 2,",
  "said to have been destroyed,",
  "there remained many a colony",
  "that people could live in again",
  "after only minor",
  "maintenance.",
  "And some colonies,",
  "like Side 6, avoided",
  "the war altogether.",
  "Such neutral colonies, despite",
  "being at war, were by custom",
  "recognized in effect as",
  "demilitarized zones.",
  "In space, all-out war among humans",
  "would lead at once to",
  "a war of extinction,",
  "so people were rationally",
  "acquiring a means to avoid war:",
  "a method of settling things",
  "with battles between",
  "mobile suits alone.",
  "Which is precisely why, one could",
  "say, the Titans were loathed",
  "all the more.",
  "Many of the surviving colonies",
  "had loathed Zeon's chosen-people",
  "elitism too, yet suffering",
  "under Federation economic control",
  "and poverty as refugees swelled,",
  "they put their hopes in the AEUG,",
  "their own representatives.",
  "If the technology of the mobile",
  "suit was born",
  "in the One Year War,",
  "the seven years since were",
  "humanity's time to digest it.",
  "After all,",
  "a humanoid 20 meters tall,",
  "a weapon for space and ground--",
  "that the idea itself",
  "ever won acceptance",
  "is close to a miracle.",
  "The Earth Federation in particular",
  "was struggling to settle accounts",
  "for the Gundam,",
  "made by a lone genius",
  "with no regard for budget,",
  "and for the GM series,",
  "mass-produced in haste",
  "by any means possible.",
  "Beam weapons and",
  "Luna Titanium, the flashy",
  "technologies, aside,",
  "in almost every other respect",
  "it was ten years behind.",
  "Even the beam weapons",
  "never saw brilliant success;",
  "in the end, the GM series",
  "had to switch its main weapon",
  "from beams to",
  "machine guns.",
  "So the Federation seized",
  "Zeon research bases scattered",
  "across the Earth Sphere,",
  "researchers, test pilots and all,",
  "and folded them into its forces.",
  "They were generally treated well,",
  "and they in turn developed",
  "with enthusiasm, so that",
  "ex-Zeon staff came to be known",
  "for their tenacity.",
  "Thus the Hizack, a hybrid of",
  "the Zaku and GM, and the",
  "Galbaldy Beta, an evolution of",
  "the Gelgoog and Gyan, and others",
  "pushed aside pure Federation MS",
  "to become the army's mainstay.",
  "Larger transformable MS",
  "were also being designed,",
  "but the Salamis class built",
  "under the Vinson Plan",
  "could hardly operate them;",
  "and above all, in peacetime,",
  "what was wanted was reliable",
  "technology that worked steadily.",
  "A weapon anyone",
  "could use at any time:",
  "that was the military's true path.",
  "That is precisely why",
  "a plan to develop the \"Gundam,\"",
  "a mobile suit with",
  "peaky performance",
  "needed only in wartime,",
  "was seen as an omen",
  "of coming upheaval."
 ]
}
